stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Connecting : channel created

    Connecting --> Connected : handshake complete\n(first ack received)
    Connecting --> Disconnected : inactivity timeout\nor retransmit exhausted

    Connected --> Disconnecting : local close initiated\n(Disconnect sent)
    Connected --> Disconnected : inactivity_timeout\npeer_idle > 300,000ms\nOR retransmit_count > 20

    Disconnecting --> Disconnected : remote ack received\nor inactivity timeout

    Disconnected --> [*]

    note right of Connected
        Keepalive every 1,000ms
        ACK timeout: 700ms per reliable msg
        Max retransmits: 20 (strict >)
        TX window: 45 slots (VecDeque)
        RX window: 64 slots (VecDeque)
        last_sent / last_received tracked separately
    end note

    note right of Connecting
        PROTOCOL_VERSION = 391
    end note